  "content": "<img alt=\"Weekly Update 522: Live From Oslo with Scott Helme\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2026/09/IMMIA_Tg6Rnso.png\" /><p>Heads up: the first 7 mins is a bit quiet until we worked out the external mic was misbehaving - sorry! But get through that and have a listen to Scott&apos;s experiences with how Report URI is identifying malware-infected machines within orgs, all due to CSP reporting. It&apos;s a super cool use of the technology, and I&apos;m sure there&apos;s an awesome potential for it that neither of us has really thought about yet. Plus, the crazy rate of malicious browser extensions he&apos;s picking up with help from &quot;Rory&quot;, his local OpenClaw instance.</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div><div style=\"width: 170px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/au/podcast/troy-hunts-weekly-update-podcast/id1176454699?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 522: Live From Oslo with Scott Helme\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/05/Listen-on-Apple-Podcasts.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 175px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7LAAxaabizMAXnJe0s3xjQ30q12EVmjt&amp;ref=troyhunt.com\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 522: Live From Oslo with Scott Helme\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2024/09/Watch-and-Listen-on-YouTube.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 118px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7jMtKFohdrw6qmz8AkLqit?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 522: Live From Oslo with Scott Helme\" class=\"kg-image\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2019/10/spotify.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 120px; display: inline-block;\"><a href=\"https://omny.fm/shows/troy-hunt-weekly-update/playlists/podcast.rss?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 522: Live From Oslo with Scott Helme\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/07/Download-via-RSS.svg\" /></a></div></div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->"
